  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.0": "Day 34",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.1": "",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.2": "After yesterday's trouble I decided it's best",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.3": "I finally get my hands on some diamond tools.",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.4": "",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.5": "That's what past me thought anyways,",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.6": "if I knew I would accidentally drop my amethyst",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.7": "hook down by the deepslate water lakes,",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.8": "I would have never went down there.",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.9": "",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.10": "If anyone finds this letter drifting amid the",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.11": "oceans, you are welcome to take my precious",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.12": "Amethyst Hook. Once you've caught at least",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.13": "one epic fish, the <scuncommon>Older Anglers</scuncommon>",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.14": "will shine their blessing upon you and",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.15": "my amethyst hook will bite your hook.",
  "starcatcher.message.amethyst_hook.sender": "Roguy",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.0": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.1": "'Buy my bottles! Buy my bottles!'",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.2": "'They are <sclava>Lava-Proof™</sclava>!!'",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.3": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.4": "'I promise they really are <sclava>Lava-Proof™</sclava>!'",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.5": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.6": "I am so tired of these SCAMMERS promising",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.7": "<sclava>Lava-Proof™</sclava> bottles, as if anything could",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.8": "survive being submerged in lava! Wanna see",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.9": "what I think of your stupid <sclava>Lava-Proof™</sclava>",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.10": "bottles??",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.11": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.12": "This letter is going right into this so-called",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.13": "'<sclava>Lava-Proof™</sclava> Bottle' and straight to the",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.14": "nearest lava pool I can find! Heh, that will",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.15": "show them.",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_1.sender": "Arn the Skeptic",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.0": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.1": "If anyone finds this letter, I would like",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.2": "to apologise about my previous letter.",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.3": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.4": "These <sclava>Lava-Proof™</sclava> bottles really work.",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.5": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.6": "I must admit after so many scams and",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.7": "promises of <sclava>Lava-Proof™</sclava> bottles I was",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.8": "skeptical and never even gave them a shot.",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.9": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.10": "What can I say, you live and you learn.",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.11": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.12": "I have to go now, I heard there's a new",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.13": "so-called 'lava-proof' enchantment. As if.",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.14": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.15": "",
  "starcatcher.message.lava_proof_2.sender": "Arn the Skeptic",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.0": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.1": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.2": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.3": "Day 201",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.4": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.5": "It has now been over half a year since I",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.6": "embarked on this journey to find a",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.7": "<scrare>Heart of the Sea</scrare>. My hope grows dim but",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.8": "I will search for it until the end of my days.",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.9": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.10": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.11": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.12": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.13": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.14": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.15": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeful.sender": "Gauward",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.0": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.1": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.2": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.3": "Day 202",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.4": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.5": "This is hopeless. There is no <scrare>Heart of the</scrare>",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.6": "<scrare>Sea</scrare>. Those BASTARDS lied to me. I am",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.7": "never returning home. Little Jimmy will forever",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.8": "live with the thought that his dad went after an",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.9": "imaginary all-powerful item.",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.10": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.11": "It really is my fault. How could I be such a",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.12": "fool as to believe an item could possibly",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.13": "allow you to breath underwater. Unbelievable.",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.14": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.15": "",
  "starcatcher.message.hopeless.sender": "Gauward",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.0": "   Something is inserted,",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.1": "   or taken out, or examined.",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.2": "",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.3": "               Something lies dormant inside and ",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.4": "               it's been there all along.",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.5": "",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.6": "   Or you've swallowed it,",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.7": "   or you've spit it out.",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.8": "",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.9": "               Ten years or ten moments ago,",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.10": "               reflected in my eyes,",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.11": "               or floating behind yours.",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.12": "",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.13": "   In your mother's mother,",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.14": "   or your child's child,",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.15": "   in dream or awake.",
  "starcatcher.message.true_blue.sender": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.0": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.1": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.2": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.3": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.4": "I would be more careful if I were you...",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.5": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.6": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.7": "You never know what you might catch",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.8": "drifting amid the oceans.",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.9": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.10": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.11": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.12": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.13": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.14": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.15": "",
  "starcatcher.message.wither.sender": "",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.0": "",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.1": "I was thinking about how there's no",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.2": "true end to anything.",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.3": "",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.4": "Everything comes from and goes to the",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.5": "same place, nowhere.",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.6": "",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.7": "",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.8": "So, if the beginning is the end,",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.9": "and the end is the beginning,",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.10": "then what's the end anyway?",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.11": "",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.12": "Does that help you sleep better?",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.13": "Like the rosy haze of an",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.14": "apocalypse sky.",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.15": "Or the comfort inside of a lie?",
  "starcatcher.message.the_end.sender": ""
}
